### **Conversation Summary**

#### **Primary Request and Intent**
The user is developing **«ПТУ-Сошиал»** — a university platform (Spring Boot 3.5.16 + PostgreSQL 17/Redis 7/Mailpit in Docker Compose; React 19/Vite/TS SPA with MUI 7, baked into an Nginx image). Standing rules: keep `docs/spec/AGENTS.md` in permanent context, consult `docs/information_about_project.md` on demand, write **very concise** logs to `docs/agent-log.md` (request → decisions → verification), and do not modify frontend files from the other team unless explicitly asked.

**Earlier in this session:** completed task #4 — moving event-review moderation from organizers to the academic office and replacing the rating dropdown with stars (backend/frontend, tests, `docs/spec/api.md`, agent log). During full `mvn verify`, 3 pre-existing failures remained in `CertificateRequestIT` (stale tests vs. new certificate workflow: `deliveryMethod` required, `APPROVED`→`READY` needs an uploaded PDF); the user has not answered whether to fix those.

**Current task (approved with "Proceed."):**
1. Fix the case-opening reel on the frontend: after the spin, the "return to center" moves to an unexpected place and reveals a reward different from the centered card.
2. Create a large demo dataset (several groups, full battle pass, themed cases with working rewards, tasks, etc.) so everything can be demonstrated.

#### **Key Technical Concepts**
- Flyway migrations V1–V19 (`ddl-auto=validate`), dev profile `SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=dev`, `DevDataSeeder` (`@Profile("dev")`, idempotent).
- `DevDataSeeder` seeds: 2 faculties, 2 departments, 3 groups (ИС-21, ИС-22, ЭК-21), 5 disciplines, current semester, office account (`office@ptu.local` / `office12345`), admin (`admin@ptu.local` / `AdminPtu2026!`).
- Case/reward/pass schema (V10/V14/V17/V18):
  - `cases(id, name, description, rarity, price, active, image_data, image_content_type)`
  - `campus_case_reward_catalog(id, case_id, reward_name, cosmetic_type, rarity, weight, image_data, image_content_type)`; cosmetic types: `avatar`, `avatar-frame`, `profile-background`, `badge`; rarities: `Обычный`, `Редкий`, `Эпический`.
  - `campus_pass_reward_catalog(season_id, track free|premium, level 1..50, title, reward_kind case|cosmetic, cosmetic_type, rarity, case_id)`; constraint: `case` requires `case_id`, null `cosmetic_type`; `cosmetic` requires `cosmetic_type`, null `case_id`; unique `(season_id, track, level)`.
  - Current pass catalog has only 50 rows: free at levels not divisible by 5 (cases), premium at levels divisible by 5 (badge cosmetics).
  - `campus_pass_seasons` (one active), `campus_pass_accounts(user_id, season_id, premium_pass_owned)`, `campus_pass_reward_claims`.
  - Pass level = `CampusRules.passLevel(academic_rating)` = `min(50, (exp + 19) / 20)`; frontend uses `Math.floor(experience / 20)`.
- Opening a case debits `cases.price` from `wallets.currency_balance`, deletes/decrements the inventory case, inserts a cosmetic into `inventory_items` (`item_kind`, `cosmetic_type`, `source`, `image_data`, `image_content_type`).
- `inventory_items.case_id` is NOT NULL even for cosmetics → must reference a real case.
- `CampusService.eventMapper` maps `participation_mode`: `COLLECTIVE` → `GROUP`, else `INDIVIDUAL`; `formatMode` maps `"group"` → `COLLECTIVE`.
- `AuthenticatedImage` fetches via axios `responseType: 'blob'` and renders `URL.createObjectURL(blob)`; SVG (`image/svg+xml`) works.
- Image endpoints (`CampusController`) return `ImageEntity` bytes with `MediaType` from DB.
- Demo credentials to use: all demo accounts password `demo12345`.
- Test creds already known: `office@ptu.local/office12345`, `admin@ptu.local/AdminPtu2026!`; Mailpit UI at `http://localhost:8025`; app at `http://localhost`.

#### **All User Messages**
1. "Твой список задач: изучить /docs/spec/AGENTS.md, прочесть общую информацию по проекту в docs/information_about_project.md, хранить информацию из 1-го файла в контексте на постоянной основе, ко второму - обращаться по мере необходимости. Так же, ты обязан писать логи в agent-log.md … пиши логи очень лаконично и экономно для сохранения токенов. После выполнения этих действий, в рамках теста напиши первый лог."
