#### **Files and Code Sections**

- **`frontend/src/pages/CampusPages.tsx`** — `InventoryPage` reel logic located at lines ~1210–1414.
    - **Importance:** holds the case-opening animation; user explicitly asked to fix it.
    - **Changes:** replaced the `useEffect` that rolled to a random offset (`settleRange = 2 * 156`) and then settled to hardcoded `finalOffset`, causing a different card under the marker. New version measures the winner card in the DOM, overshoots it slightly and settles exactly on it, and keeps the suspense highlight on `winnerIndex`.
    - **New code:**
```tsx
const frame = requestAnimationFrame(() => {
  const windowEl = reelWindow.current;
  const trackEl = reelTrack.current;
  if (!windowEl || !trackEl) return;
  const visibleWidth = windowEl.clientWidth;
  const maxOffset = Math.max(0, trackEl.scrollWidth - visibleWidth);
  // Центрируем именно карточку победителя по её реальной геометрии в DOM.
  const winnerEl = trackEl.children[winnerIndex] as HTMLElement | undefined;
  const winnerCenter = winnerEl
    ? winnerEl.offsetLeft + winnerEl.offsetWidth / 2
    : winnerIndex * 156 + 12 + 74;
  const finalOffset = Math.min(maxOffset, Math.max(0, winnerCenter - visibleWidth / 2));
  const reduceMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

  if (reduceMotion) {
    setReelPhase('stopped');
    setReelOffset(finalOffset);
    completionTimer = window.setTimeout(() => setRevealComplete(true), 80);
    return;
  }

  // Докручиваем чуть дальше победителя и возвращаемся к нему — без смены карточки под маркером.
  const overshoot = Math.random() * 40 + 24;
  const rollOffset = Math.min(maxOffset, finalOffset + overshoot);
  setReelPhase('rolling');
  setSuspenseIndex(null);
  setReelOffset(rollOffset);

  suspenseTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {
    setReelPhase('suspense');
    setSuspenseIndex(winnerIndex);
    revealTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {
      setReelPhase('settling');
      setSuspenseIndex(null);
      setReelOffset(finalOffset);
      completionTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {
        setReelPhase('stopped');
        setRevealComplete(true);
      }, 800);
    }, 700);
  }, 4000);
});
```
    - Rest unchanged: `handleOpenCase` fills 18 random filler entries, winner at 18, 5 trailing; dialog renders `.case-reel-window`/`.case-reel-track` with `transform: translateX(-${reelOffset}px)`, marker, status text, and result card when `revealComplete`.

- **`backend/src/main/java/com/ptu/backend/dev/DevDataSeeder.java`**
    - **Importance:** base dev seeder must run before demo seeder.
    - **Changes:** added `import org.springframework.core.annotation.Order;` and `@Order(1)` on the class.

- **`backend/src/main/java/com/ptu/backend/dev/DevDemoDataSeeder.java`** (NEW, ~700 lines)
    - **Importance:** the demo dataset requested by the user.
    - **Implementation:** `@Slf4j @Component @Profile("dev") @Order(2)`, constructor `(JdbcTemplate jdbc, PasswordEncoder passwordEncoder)`, single `@Transactional run(...)`.
    - **Guard:** if `student@ptu.local` exists and has inventory with `source = 'Демо-набор'` → log "демо-данные уже загружены" and return; otherwise seeds (password `demo12345` hashed once).
    - **Constants:** 8 groups `ИС-21, ИС-22, ИС-23, ПИ-21, ПИ-22, ЭК-21, ЭК-22, БД-21`; 6 students per group; 48 names; leader ratings `{1250, 640, 520, 460, 380, 320, 260, 200}`; premium types `avatar, avatar-frame, profile-background, badge`; 12 cosmetic combos; 7 themed `CaseSeed`s (Кейс первокурсника 100, программиста 150, дизайнера 150, старосты 200, сессии 250, выпускника 300, киберспорта 180) with weighted rewards covering all `(type, rarity)` combinations.
    - **Key flow:**
```java
String passwordHash = passwordEncoder.encode(PASSWORD);
UUID semesterId = id("select id from semesters where is_current");
UUID itFaculty = id("select id from faculties where name = ?", "Факультет информационных технологий");
UUID economicsFaculty = id("select id from faculties where name = ?", "Факультет экономики");
UUID isDepartment = id("select id from departments where name = ?", "Кафедра информационных систем");
UUID economicsDepartment = id("select id from departments where name = ?", "Кафедра экономики");

UUID teacher = user("teacher@ptu.local", "Иванов Пётр Сергеевич", "TEACHER", passwordHash);
UUID teacher2 = user("teacher2@ptu.local", "Кузнецова Мария Андреевна", "TEACHER", passwordHash);
UUID organizer = user("organizer@ptu.local", "Смирнова Анна Викторовна", "ORGANIZER", passwordHash);
UUID office = firstId("select id from users where role = 'ACADEMIC_OFFICE' order by created_at limit 1", teacher);
```
    - Disciplines created: existing 5 + «Алгоритмы и структуры данных», «Мобильная разработка», «Проектный практикум», «Дизайн интерфейсов», «Бухгалтерский учёт», «Маркетинг», «Статистика»; teacher assignments for all groups; cases + reward catalogs with generated SVG images; `backfillImages(legacyCase)` for «Кейс кампуса».
    - **Student generation:** index 0 = `student@ptu.local` (Петров Алексей, ИС-21 leader, rating 1250, wallet 5000); indices 1..47 = `studentN@ptu.local`; ratings `20 * (2 + ((index*7) % 28))` for non-leaders; wallets `300 + 20*((index*11)%60)`; premium pass for index 0, index < 3, and every 4th; profiles upserted then leader set with `update student_profiles set is_group_leader = false where group_id = ?` first.
    - **Inventory:** every student gets 2 cases; main student gets 14 cases (2 per themed case) + 12 cosmetics, equipping avatar/frame/background inventory ids.
    - **Pass catalog (`seedPassCatalog`):** for levels 1..50 upserts **both** tracks. Free = themed case cycling; premium = cosmetic cycling with rarity tiers (`Обычный` ≤ 9, `Редкий` ≤ 29, `Эпический` 30+) and themed titles from `premiumTitle(type, rarity)`.
    - **Pass claims:** main student claims free levels ≤12 and premium levels ≤6.
    - **Tasks:** 9 tasks across ИС-21/ИС-22/ИС-23/ПИ-21/ПИ-22/ЭК-21 with varied due dates; submissions in statuses `ACCEPTED` (grade + awarded_rating + feedback), `RETURNED` (feedback), `SUBMITTED`.
    - **Schedule:** 10 weekly entries for ИС-21/ИС-22/ИС-23/ПИ-21/ПИ-22/ЭК-21 (times `09:00–10:30`, `10:45–12:15`, `12:30–14:00`, `14:15–15:45`), plus 2 `campus_schedule_changes` for ИС-21.
    - **Events:** 7 events (Хакатон, Экскурсия, День первокурсника, Эко-субботник, Киноклуб, Волейбол, Ярмарка вакансий) with individual/collective modes, БОА/БУА points, group registrations for collective events, participations, 10 approved reviews on «День первокурсника» (enables rating display), pending reviews including one with a blocked word (`"Организация говно..."` → flagged), one approved and one rejected review on «Эко-субботник».
    - **Certificates:** 8 requests across statuses `PENDING`, `IN_PROGRESS`, `READY` (with a minimal PDF in `certificate_request_documents`), `ISSUED`, `REJECTED` with reason; types `EDUCATION`, `INCOME`, `MILITARY`, `OTHER` (with `custom_title`).
    - **Group confirmations:** 2 PENDING rows for students of ИС-21/ИС-22.
    - **Helpers:** `user`, `groupId`, `disciplineId`, `id`, `firstId`, `firstIdOrNull`, `count`, `assign`, `ensureCase`, `backfillImages`, `caseIdByName`, `giveCosmetic`, `cosmeticImage`, `task`, `submission`, `event`, `groupRegistration`, `participate`, `review`, `certificate`, `seedGroupConfirmations`, `premiumTitle`, `rarityColor`, `databaseRarity`, `svg`, `escapeXml`; records `CaseSeed`, `Reward`, `Student`.
    - **SVG image generation** (used for cases/rewards): 320×200, gradient from `colorA`→`colorB`, decorative circles, white 20px text with escaped XML.

- **`frontend/src/styles.css`** (read only) — reel classes: `.case-reel-window` (180px height, overflow hidden), `.case-reel-track` (flex, gap 8px, padding 18px 12px), `.case-reel-rolling` (4s transition), `.case-reel-settling` (.7s), `.case-reel-item` (148px), `.case-reel-winner`, `.case-reel-nearby`, `.case-reel-marker` (centered), `.case-reveal-result`.
- **`backend/src/main/java/com/ptu/backend/campus/CampusService.java`** (read) — key methods `pass` (~685), `claimPassReward` (~755), `openCase` (~813), `insertInventory`/`insertCaseInventory` (~1127), `caseRewards`, `catalog` (~481), `eventView`, `moderationQueue`, `debit`, `academicRating` (~1211), `databaseRarity` (~1381), `eventMapper` (~1417).
- **Migrations V2–V19** (read) — schema reference for all seeded tables; note `users` role check includes `ADMIN` (V12), certificates include `delivery_method`/`custom_title`/`description` (V16), `transactions` type list includes `CASE_OPEN`, `PASS_PREMIUM` (V10).
- **`backend/src/main/java/com/ptu/backend/workspace/WorkspaceTaskService.java`** (read) — task listing/grading logic; student tasks query by profile group; teacher submissions by teacher's tasks.
- **`frontend/src/components/AuthenticatedImage.tsx`** (read) — blob-based image rendering.
- **`docker-compose.yml`** (read) — backend uses `${SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE:-dev}`, seed env vars, nginx on port 80, Mailpit on 8025.

#### **Errors and Fixes**
- **Prior session (context):**
    - Spring context failed: `ReviewService` had two constructors → added `@Autowired` to the public 2-arg constructor.
    - IT compile errors in `EventReviewModerationIT` → explicit `new TypeReference<List<Map<String, Object>>>() {}` and `@SuppressWarnings("unchecked")` cast.
    - Unique index `ux_reviews_activity_author` violation in test data → different students per review.
    - Flaky queue size due to shared DB → filter queue by `eventId`.
    - Stale `CertificateRequestIT`: `deliveryMethod` now `@NotNull`; added `"deliveryMethod":"PICKUP"` (8 → 3 failures); remaining 3 are workflow-expectation mismatches, left for a separate decision.
    - No local `npm`/`node` → frontend verified via `docker compose build nginx`.
    - Shell quirks: quote `--include=*.java` patterns; memory system unavailable.
- **This segment:** no errors encountered yet (no compilation/build has been run for the new seeder or frontend edit).

#### **Current Work and Next Step**

**Current Work:**
- The frontend case-reel `useEffect` in `frontend/src/pages/CampusPages.tsx` has been rewritten to measure the winner card via DOM (`trackEl.children[winnerIndex]`), center it exactly, add a 24–64 px overshoot, highlight `winnerIndex` during suspense, settle back over the existing `.7s` transition, and unlock the result after 800 ms.
- `DevDataSeeder` now has `@Order(1)`; the new `DevDemoDataSeeder` (`@Order(2)`) has been written with all demo data described above.
- The todo list is still unchanged (7 items, all marked not completed).
- Nothing has been compiled or tested yet for the new code.

**Next Step:**
1. Compile/verify the backend (`mvn -q -DskipTests compile` or `docker compose build backend`), fixing any Java/SQL issues in `DevDemoDataSeeder`.
2. Update todos (mark frontend reel fix done; seeder items as applicable).
3. Rebuild/start the stack (`docker compose up -d --build`) and verify demo data appears (login as `student@ptu.local` / `demo12345`, check inventory/pass/cases/events; teacher/organizer accounts).
4. Verify the frontend build via `docker compose build nginx` and manually confirm the reel stops on the same card as the awarded reward.
5. Write `docs/demo-data.md` (accounts + what to show) and a concise entry in `docs/agent-log.md`.

